{"id":"word:hebrew:H8142","type":"word","title":"שֵׁנָה","subtitle":"H8142 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"sleep","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שֵׁנָה (H8142) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 23 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שֵׁנָה (shênâh) means sleep First listed occurrence: Dan 2 1."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שֵׁנָה","transliteration":"shênâh","pronunciation":"shay-naw'","strong":"H8142","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8142","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["שְׁנַ֣ת","שְׁנַת","שֵׁנָ֣ה","שֵׁ֭נוֹת","וּ/שְׁנָת֖/וֹ"],"morphs":[["HNcfsa",5],["HNcfsc",4],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",4],["HNcfsc/Sp3mp",2],["HNcfpa",2],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",1],["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",1],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp1cs",1],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3mp",1],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"sleep","usage":"sleep.","full":"H8142. shenah or shena שְׁנָת שֵׁנָא, שֵׁנָה, noun feminine sleep — שֵׁנָה Psa 90:5 3 t.; שֵׁנָא 127:2 , שְׁנָת 132:4 (Ges § 80 g, h .); construct שְׁנַת Jer 51:39 3 t.; שְׁנָתִי Gen 31:40 ; Jer 31:26 , etc.; plural absolute שֵׁנוֺת Prov 6:10 ; 24:33 ; &#8212; sleep Gen 28:16 (J), Judg 16:14 , 20 ; Prov 3:24 ; 6:9 ; 20:13 ; Eccl 5:11 ; Jer 31:26 ; Zech 4:1 ; Prov 6:4 (|| תְּנוּמָה ); תְּנוּמוֺת מְעַט שֵׁנוֺת מְעַט 6:10 = 24:33 (these two of sluggard עָצֵל אִישׁ ; see also 6:9 ; 20:13 ); note also מֵעֵינָ֑י שְׁנָתִי וַתִּדּד Gen 31:40 (E) and my sleep fled from mine eyes ; הַמֶּלֶךְ שְׁנַת נָ֑דֲדָה Est 6:1 ; שְׁנָתָם וְנִגְזְלָה Prov 4:16 ; עָלָיו נִהְיְתָה וּשְׁנָתוֺ Dan 2:1 ; רֹאֵה אֵינֶנּוּ בְּעֵינָיו שֵׁנָה Eccl 8:16 ; לְעֵינָ֑י שְׁנָת אֶתֵּן אִם Psa 132:4 (all of lack of sleep); שֵׁנָ֑א לִידִידוֺ יִתֵּן 127:2 = he giveth to his beloved in sleep , compare Ges § 118 , 3; of sleep of death (so Arabic Dozy ii. 806 ) Job 14:12 ; Psa 90:5 (compare De Che); so, as accusative of congnate meaning with verb, 76:6 ; Jer 51:39 , 57 (in these two שְׁנַתעֿוֺלָם ). יֶשְׁנוֺ see יֵשׁ .","rootNote":"or שֵׁנָא ; (Psalm 127:2), from 3462 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Dan 2 1","keyReferences":["Dan 2 1","Eccl 5 11","Eccl 8 16","Esth 6 1","Gen 28 16","Gen 31 40","Jer 31 26","Jer 51 39"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":23,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Dan 2 1","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/שְׁנָת֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Eccl 5 11","book":"Eccl","chapter":5,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁנַ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Eccl 8 16","book":"Eccl","chapter":8,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֵׁנָ֕ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Esth 6 1","book":"Esth","chapter":6,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁנַ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Gen 28 16","book":"Gen","chapter":28,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/שְּׁנָת/וֹ֒","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Gen 31 40","book":"Gen","chapter":31,"verse":40,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁנָתִ֖/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Jer 31 26","book":"Jer","chapter":31,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/שְׁנָתִ֖/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Jer 51 39","book":"Jer","chapter":51,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁנַת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Jer 51 57","book":"Jer","chapter":51,"verse":57,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁנַת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Job 14 12","book":"Job","chapter":14,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/שְּׁנָתָֽ/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Judg 16 14","book":"Judg","chapter":16,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/שְּׁנָת֔/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Judg 16 20","boo